# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# CertiChain — Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env and fill in the values.
# NEVER commit .env to Git.
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ─── Database ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local dev (Docker on port 5433):
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://certichain:password@localhost:5433/certichain

# Production examples:
# Neon:     postgresql://user:pass@host.neon.tech/certichain?sslmode=require
# Supabase: postgresql://postgres:pass@db.xxx.supabase.co:5432/postgres
# Railway:  postgresql://postgres:pass@containers-us-west-xxx.railway.app:7xxx/railway

# ─── Docker ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Used by docker-compose.yml only (not the backend itself)
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=change_this_in_production

# ─── Backend ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
NODE_ENV=development
PORT=4000
BACKEND_URL=http://localhost:4000

# JWT — generate with:
# node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(64).toString('hex'))"
JWT_SECRET=CHANGE_THIS_TO_A_LONG_RANDOM_SECRET_AT_LEAST_64_CHARS
JWT_EXPIRES_IN=7d

# ─── Frontend ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Dev:
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:4000/api
VITE_APP_URL=http://localhost:5173
FRONTEND_URL=http://localhost:5173

# Production (replace with your actual domains):
# VITE_API_URL=https://api.certichain.app/api
# VITE_APP_URL=https://certichain.app
# FRONTEND_URL=https://certichain.app

# ─── File Storage ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Options: local | s3 | cloudinary
# local = files saved to STORAGE_LOCAL_DIR on the server
STORAGE_PROVIDER=local
STORAGE_LOCAL_DIR=./uploads

# AWS S3 (set STORAGE_PROVIDER=s3 to use)
AWS_REGION=us-east-1
AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
AWS_S3_BUCKET=certichain-files

# Cloudinary (set STORAGE_PROVIDER=cloudinary to use)
CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=
CLOUDINARY_API_KEY=
CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET=

# ─── Email ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Options: log | smtp | resend | sendgrid
# log = dev mode, emails printed to console (no real delivery)
EMAIL_PROVIDER=log
EMAIL_FROM=noreply@certichain.com
EMAIL_FROM_NAME=CertiChain

# SMTP (set EMAIL_PROVIDER=smtp to use)
SMTP_HOST=smtp.example.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USER=
SMTP_PASS=

# Resend (set EMAIL_PROVIDER=resend to use — recommended for production)
RESEND_API_KEY=

# ─── Rate Limiting ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Window in milliseconds (900000 = 15 minutes)
RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW_MS=900000
# Max requests per window — global
RATE_LIMIT_MAX=100
# Max requests per window — /api/verify/* (stricter)
VERIFY_RATE_LIMIT_MAX=30
